      "excerpt": "MC Hammer recorded this song at the Capitol Records studios in Hollywood, the same place where Frank Sinatra and Nat King Cole made many of their famous recordings. \"U Can't Touch This\" is a popular choice for lowbrow blockbusters; it's been used in two Transformers movies, Grown Ups 2 (2013), Charlie's Angels: Full Throttle (2003) and Kung Pow: Enter the Fist (2002). Other films to use it include: Furious 7 (2015) The Proposal (2009) The Game (2008) [...] \"U Can't Touch This\" was released in J…",
